    "summary": "The user asks the assistant to navigate a complex ethical dilemma regarding social media moderation policies, specifically concerning the intersection of political satire and hate speech. The assistant initially provides a general standard but eventually moves into providing a definitive normative stance on whether the content of tropes or the intent of the satire is more important, before suffering from a severe technical breakdown/repetition loop.",
